{
  "name": "dsh-desktop-web-refresh",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "在 DSH Desktop 标题栏（与最小化/还原/关闭同栏）的「编辑」右侧新增蓝底白字伪 3D 的「刷新」按钮，按下即重新加载 DSH Desktop 页面；有对话运行时按钮禁用并弹警告，全静默才允许刷新。",
  "main": "index.js",
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": []
    }
  }
}
